#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-30-01-000006.md:8
msgid "メッセージ"
msgstr "Message"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-30-01-000006.md:10
msgid "プロジェクト、アクター、キャラクターの各項目を入力してから続行してください。"
msgstr "Complete the project, actor, and character fields before continuing."

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-30-01-000006.md:12
msgid "原因"
msgstr "Why this happens"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-30-01-000006.md:14
msgid "現在のセッションに、データの場所を決めるためのプロジェクト、Actor、Characterのいずれかがありません。"
msgstr ""
"The current session lacks the project, Actor or Character needed to "
"locate its data."

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-30-01-000006.md:15
msgid "保存には、セッションのDCCに対応する既存のMaya .ma/.mbまたはBlender .blendシーンも必要です。"
msgstr ""
"Saving also requires an existing Maya .ma/.mb or Blender .blend scene "
"appropriate to the session renderer."

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-30-01-000006.md:17
msgid "対処方法"
msgstr "How to resolve it"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-30-01-000006.md:19
msgid ""
"完全なセッションを開くか、Session "
"Settingsでプロジェクトフォルダー、Actor、Characterを設定してください。例えばC:/FCSProject、Actor01、Character01の場合、データはC:/FCSProject/FCS/Actor01/Character01に配置されます。"
msgstr ""
"Open a complete session, or set its project folder, Actor and Character "
"in Session Settings. For example, project C:/FCSProject, Actor Actor01, "
"Character Character01 identifies C:/FCSProject/FCS/Actor01/Character01."

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-30-01-000006.md:20
msgid ""
"Session "
"InfoでProject、Actor、Characterの各フォルダーの存在を確認し、DCCに合う拡張子の既存のシーンを選択してください。相対パスはプロジェクトのルートを基準に解決されます。修正後にSaveを再実行してください。"
msgstr ""
"In Session Info, verify that the Project, Actor and Character folders "
"exist, then select an existing scene with the extension appropriate to "
"the renderer. Relative scene paths resolve from the project root. Retry "
"Save after correcting those fields."

